{"text": "Gaco\n\nProduct Data Sheet: GacoFlex\u2122 $20 Series\n\nRevised: 11/2020\n\nGACOFLEX\u2122 $20 SERIES\nSOLVENT-FREE 100% SILICONE ROOF COATINGS\n1.) DESCRIPTION\n\nGacoFlex $20 Series Silicone coatings are solvent-free, single-component waterproof elastomeric moisture-curing\nslicone coatings.\n\n2.) RECOMMENDED USE:\nGacoFlex $20 Series Silicone Coatings may be used as maintenance coating systems over existing elastomeric roof\ncoatings, metal roofs, built-up roofing, mineral cap sheets, modified bitumen (APP and SBS) and weathered single ply\nmembranes (EPDM, PVC, CSPE, and TPOICPA) where the membrane is in sound condition but requires a renewal\n(of the membrane surface due to the normal effects of aging and use.\nGacoFlex $20 Series Slicone Coatings are ideal for use over sprayed-in-place polyurethane foam roofing such as\nGacoFlex F2733 GacoRoofFoam\u2122, concrete, plywood decking (when properly applied over an approved base coal)\nand on roof surfaces that are used as part of rainwater catchment systems,\nWhen properly applied, the GacoFlex $20 Coating System provides a seamless weather-tight seal that protects the\nsubstrate from degradation caused by ultraviolet light, water and other normal weathering hazards.\n\n3.) COLOR:\n\u2018$2000 White;\n$2022 Gray;\n\u2018$2048 Tan;\n\u2018$2028 Dark Gray (available as special order only)\n\n4) APPROVAL:\nUnderwviters Laboratory -UL790-Class A\n\u2018= Approved with GacoRoofFoam F2733 and F273 Ne et\n\u2018+ Approved maintenance coating over all FM Approved Roofs \u2018tare roscoe\n(Single Ply, BUR, Cap Sheet, Metal, etc.)\n\nEnergy Star S j\n05 Re ang court \u2014cancorancote Soe Bw fH\n\nMiami-Dade Product Control-NOA 12-0426 SS Laie nas\nFlorida Product ControLFL14724-RI \u201ccare\nTexas Department of Insurance-RC-353\nNSF P151 Certification of rainwater catchment system components\n\n5.) TYPICAL PROPERTIES,\n\nPROPER\u2019 TEST RESULT TM 05694 REQUIREMENT\nTENSILE STRENGTH @ 73\u00b0F (23\u00b0C) \u2018ASTM 0412 | 450 psi 150 min\nELONGATION AT BREAK @ 73\u00b0F (23\u00b0C) \u2018ASTM D412 | _ 174%. 100 min\nTENSILE STRENGTH @ 0\u00b0F (-18\u00b0C) \u2018ASTM D412 | 574 psi 7150 min\nELONGATION AT BREAK @ 0\u00b0F (-18\u2018C) ASTM D412 | 169%. 400 min\nTEAR RESISTANCE (DIE C) \u2018ASTM 0624 | 38.5 Ib/inch 20 min\nWET ADHESION \u2018ASTM 06694\n\u2018SPRAY POLYURETHANE FOAM\n\u2018ACRYLIC COATING\nGALVANIZED METAL WITH E5320 PRIMER ASTM\nBUR WITH \u00a35320 c7earog0s | PaS\u00ae 20min\nEPDM WITH \u00a35320 PRIMER\nPVC WITH E5320 PRIMER\n\ngaco.com + ~\u2014=\u20148 00.33.0196",
